    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d88">

                <pb facs="0184" n="82" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg82"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.2315/82</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Venezuela</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">McGoodwin</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-09-17"><hi rendition="#italic">September 17,
                        1919</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 490</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I enclose for your confidential information
                    an extract from a despatch from the American Minister at Bogotá,<anchor n="86"
                        xml:id="d88-f1"/> reporting a recent conversation with the President of
                    Colombia, in which he requested that this Government would use its good offices
                    with the Government of Venezuela to induce it to continue the negotiations for
                    the settlement of all questions covered by the Convention between the two
                    Governments of November 3, 1916, in addition to those which will be decided by
                    the arbitration of the Government of Switzerland now pending in virtue of the
                    provisions of that Treaty.</p>
                <pb facs="0185" n="83" xml:id="pg83"/>
                <p>You may use your good offices with this end in view, orally and informally
                    discussing the matter with the Venezuelan Minister of Foreign Relations.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
